	(text "At 10 bits on 3.3 V one LSB is 3.22 mV, so 75 mV is still 23 counts."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 125.984 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "055013f2-b681-44ab-89bf-fc1b931e2393")
	)
	(text "tacho bias divider - a ~50k source - and a 10k/10k load here would drag"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 181.864 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "10d46371-5903-4479-89fd-b7782ec4bf24")
	)
	(text "putting ITRIP ~1.22 A at 2.7 V - inside range without clipping."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 166.624 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2f4dfb59-d81b-4462-b51a-f749244bdba6")
	)
	(text "detection already needs 350 ms of stability, so this is free."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 207.264 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "35d69615-3704-4dbe-8817-bf0f5497597d")
	)
	(text "IPROPI channels are NOT divided. R_IPROPI on the motor sheet is 2k7,"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 161.544 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "36bfddbe-37fd-4ad8-b4ef-b6cf4dee0574")
	)
	(text "ADC_M* USE 1M DIVIDERS, NOT 10k. Those lines sit on the EV3 100k/100k"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 176.784 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3b34f132-6c72-441e-839d-a67983b6415b")
	)
	(text "must use the measured ratio, not the nominal 0.5."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 151.384 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3bedf061-8420-49de-8204-77e78544019b")
	)
	(text "lands at 2.5 V: mid-scale and linear, which was the whole objection to"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 105.664 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3fdcf4db-1e0f-4f40-81d2-8a14d141c7f7")
	)
	(text "already put a series resistor in each analog path and it forms part of"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 141.224 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "475d1737-ea35-4f35-bfe1-bd24fd6a95a4")
	)
	(text "using the P4 ADC. Thresholds scale with it:"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 110.744 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4c1d1719-81c8-46c2-b592-79f027283513")
	)
	(text "    open port  4800 mV -> 2400 mV     NXT touch 850-950 -> 425-475 mV"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 115.824 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5e8cb4bf-aac3-42db-9651-26a5ae4e0d6a")
	)
	(text "the power sheet, sized for the 6 x AA range (~6.0 to 9.5 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 222.504 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "70f4996d-87b9-4c7e-a706-e2e571ef5e3f")
	)
	(text "VBAT_SENSE is NOT divided here either - the battery divider belongs on"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 217.424 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "96d9548c-5c8a-4fdd-84b7-a96fb4666a70")
	)
	(text "2M, about 2.5%. The cost is ~500k source impedance into the MCP3008,"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 192.024 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a4a0d408-3f69-4df9-902d-175043a7547a")
	)
	(text "far above its 10k guideline, so CR1-4 supply the sampling charge and"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 197.104 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a64a53ea-108b-49fe-b149-66aa7eade04d")
	)
	(text "17 of 24 channels used. U6 CH1-7 are spare and no-connected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 232.664 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b1933069-e823-493f-ab37-06502aea21d6")
	)
	(text "    EV3 digital 100 mV ->   50 mV     pin 6 open  150 mV ->   75 mV"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 120.904 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ebfc897b-5180-470d-a1cb-5c8321751301")
	)
	(text "it down and destroy the documented detection voltages. 1M loads it by"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 186.944 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ecef7047-f5be-4508-b485-4cf20ce97de4")
	)
	(text "So VDD = VREF = 3.3 V and the 0-5 V channels are divided by two. 5 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 100.584 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f420cc5c-b1d4-4b15-bbc7-8558a6182fec")
	)
	(text "this divider. The ratio is fixed and known per channel, but firmware"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 146.304 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fa59d077-eee6-4bb2-933f-938f29b6f5bd")
	)
	(text "DIVIDER RATIO IS NOT EXACTLY ONE HALF. The sensor and motor front ends"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.452 136.144 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
